  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 4
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'Bu Sari:

    The bamboo grove? At this hour? (She lowers her voice.)
    Anak muda, the genderuwo naps there. Wake it and it will want a chat. And it
    is... very bad at small talk.'
